dialogue hobb
  node root hobb "Pell's chest. Nobody opens it. …Bosun's orders. I'm the bosun."
    > "Do you ever leave it?" -> move
    > "Those tattoos." if not seen:hobb.names -> names
    > "Not even the captain?" -> captain
    > "I'll leave it, then." -> bye
  node move hobb "Dinner. Dinner's when the gong goes. The gong goes when Dorrit says."
    > "And when does Dorrit say?" -> dorrit
    > "Right. Dinner." -> bye
  node dorrit hobb "When the stew's passed. Stew's never passed. We've been on biscuit since Vela. …This morning. Feels longer."
    > "Right. Biscuit." -> bye
  node names hobb "Everyone I've lost. Pell's on the back of my hand. There's room."
    > "I'm sorry." -> sorry
    > "You'll want a bigger bosun." -> bigger
  node sorry hobb "Don't be sorry. Be careful. I'm running out of arm."
  node bigger hobb "…Ha. That's my laugh for the year. You've had it."
  node captain hobb "Captain least of all. She'd read what's in it. Then she'd have to know."
    > "Right." -> bye
  node bye hobb "Good."
  # At the mess table after dinner.
  node table hobb "Nobody goes south of the reef for money. …Only for blood."
    > "Whose blood?" -> whose
    > "Those tattoos." if not seen:hobb.names -> names
    > "Is the stew good?" -> stew
    > "Enjoy your dinner." -> bye
  node whose hobb "Ours. Somebody's brother. Somebody's anybody. Show me a name, clerk, and I'll show you a crew."
  node stew hobb "It's stamped."
  # The Arcadia's manifest, given at the table (rooms.ts, below_decks).
  node manifest narrator "Hobb runs one thick finger down the Arcadia's twenty-two names. The finger stops."
    -> tam
  node tam hobb "Tam Hobb. Able seaman."
    -> sleeve
  node sleeve narrator "He rolls up his sleeve. Under a dozen others, in older ink: TAM."
    -> brother
  node brother hobb "My brother. Lost with the Arcadia, three years back. …South it is. I'll tell the lads."
    > "It says lost. Nobody ever found him, Hobb." -> room
      set crew_agree
      note crew_stand "Hobb found his brother on the Arcadia's manifest: Tam Hobb, able seaman, lost. The crew will sail south. The bosun rolled up his sleeve to tell me so, which I gather is the equivalent of a signature."
    > "There's a boy in Upper Town called Tam. He counts the ships in." if seen:tam.dad -> nephew
      set crew_agree
      note crew_stand "Hobb found his brother on the Arcadia's manifest: Tam Hobb, able seaman, lost. The crew will sail south. The bosun rolled up his sleeve to tell me so, which I gather is the equivalent of a signature."
    > "Thank you, Hobb." -> dont
      set crew_agree
      note crew_stand "Hobb found his brother on the Arcadia's manifest: Tam Hobb, able seaman, lost. The crew will sail south. The bosun rolled up his sleeve to tell me so, which I gather is the equivalent of a signature."
  node room hobb "…Then I had that one done early."
  node nephew hobb "…He'd be about nine."
    -> nephew2
  node nephew2 hobb "Then it's south twice."
  node dont hobb "Be right. That'll do for thanks."
  node fed hobb "The lads are with you. Don't make me get the needle out for you, clerk."
